From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NotAlexNoyle <alexnoyle@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Mar 2026 03:54:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Prevent server from writing to config files

An existing server.properties, bukkit.yml, commands.yml, spigot.yml,
purpur.yml or Paper configuration file (paper-global.yml,
paper-world-defaults.yml, per-world paper-world.yml) is never rewritten.
A missing file is still generated with defaults.

/whitelist on|off and /setidletimeout apply in memory only; /whitelist
tells the sender so. The legacy paper.yml conversion no longer writes
its result.

